  <Docs>
    <summary>Specifies the word-based line-break rules used by a line-break configuration.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para><see cref="F:Android.Graphics.Text.LineBreakWordStyle.Phrase" /> requests phrase-based wrapping where the locale supports it. <see cref="F:Android.Graphics.Text.LineBreakWordStyle.Auto" /> lets the platform use locale and line-count rules; it does not guarantee phrase-based wrapping.</para>
      <para><see cref="F:Android.Graphics.Text.LineBreakWordStyle.Unspecified" /> preserves the existing value during a merge. It is not the same as explicitly selecting <see cref="F:Android.Graphics.Text.LineBreakWordStyle.Auto" />.</para>
      <para>This enum exposes the <c>LINE_BREAK_WORD_STYLE_*</c> constants from <format type="text/html"><a href="https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/99b01a65cc4c104933788b3143285ab6bae65827/graphics/java/android/graphics/text/LineBreakConfig.java">Android 16 LineBreakConfig</a></format>.</para>
    </remarks>
  </Docs>
